  "subject": "a brother and sister at their family signboard shop in Chiayi who discover, the night before a noodle shop opens, that the two-storey sign they just hung has an extra digit in the phone number, and climb back up at midnight to repaint it while a police patrol shines a torch on them",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien soca, up-tempo power soca in the Trinidad carnival style. Bright brass section stabs and fanfares; ringing steel pan riff; driving four-on-the-floor soca kick with snappy snare; rolling electric bass; cowbell on the offbeat. Loud carnival-ready mix, punchy and bright. Bold male tenor lead trading lines with a female answer voice, clearly sung melody, crowd shouts on the hooks. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 156 BPM, F major. Frantic, cheeky, laughing. No reggaeton dembow, no trap drums, no autotune, no EDM drop, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n阮兜開招牌店 三代矣\n阿兄扞梯 我搵油漆\n新開的麵店 明仔載開張\n兩樓懸的招牌 金爍爍\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n頭家看一下 面變色\n電話 加一个八\n\n[Chorus]\n害矣害矣 寫毋著\n半暝十二點 閣蹈起去\n阿兄扞梯 我咧畫\n天光進前 愛改予好\n\n[Verse]\n阿兄講 是你唸毋清\n我講 是你耳空重\n油漆滴落 頭家的頭殼\n伊頭毛 變做紅色\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n巡邏車 停落來看\n問阮 是毋是咧偷\n\n[Chorus]\n害矣害矣 寫毋著\n半暝兩點 猶咧蹈懸\n阿兄扞梯 我咧畫\n警察嘛 共阮炤電火\n\n[Verse]\n天光矣 麵店開門\n頭家拍電話 試一擺\n鈴鈴鈴 阮兩人\n佇梯仔頂 拍噗仔\n\n[Bridge]\n頭家笑講 免登廣告\n規條街 攏咧看阮\n\n[Chorus]\n害矣害矣 寫毋著\n這擺號碼 總算著矣\n阿兄落梯 我落梯\n頭家請食 頭一碗麵\n\n[Outro]\n害矣害矣 莫閣錯\n下一塊 換你唸",
